@startuml
title Ott Based System Mini Reel - User Account and Video Management

[*] --> CreateAccount
CreateAccount : entry / nil
CreateAccount : do / create account
CreateAccount : exit / account created

CreateAccount --> WatchVideos
WatchVideos : entry / login
WatchVideos : do / watch videos
WatchVideos : exit / continue watching

WatchVideos --> SaveVideo : user saves video to likes list
SaveVideo : entry / save video
SaveVideo : do / save video in likes list
SaveVideo : exit / video saved

WatchVideos --> EnterDiscussion : user enters discussion option
EnterDiscussion : entry / enter discussion
EnterDiscussion : do / enter discussion
EnterDiscussion : exit / continue discussing

UploadVideo : entry / login
UploadVideo : do / upload video
UploadVideo : exit / video uploaded

LikesList : entry / login
LikesList --> WatchVideos : user views saved videos
WatchVideos : exit / continue watching
LikesList --> [*]
@enduml
